    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272464</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_270_030_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アイツらは！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Where did they go?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272532</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_270_030_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>上へ逃げたよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They made a break for the surface!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272636</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_270_030_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>持ってたの、
『不凍の流体』っての
じゃないかな……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, where are they going
with the Unfreezing Fluid?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272752</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_270_030_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もしかしたら、フラムベルクが
封じたっていう『怒れる大地』を……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It could be, they want to dissolve
the seal of the Raging Earth, as
Flamberg explained.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272836</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_270_030_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>くそっ……
行かせるかよ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Damn...! We can't let them do that!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
